The '''Black Cat Pet''' is a {{skill|combat}} [[Pet]] that is sold by the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} for {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=2000}} during the [[Spooky Festival]]. It is mainly used to increase the {{Stat|Speed}} cap, {{Stat|Magic Find}}, and {{Stat|Pet Luck}} and can be upgraded to {{Mythic}} rarity using the {{Item|Black Woolen Yarn}}.

== Usage ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Black Cat Pet''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} for {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=2000}} during the [[Spooky Festival]].

